    5. Exception Handling + Response

    # getById (flow)

      GET /students/4
             ↓
      Student DB → Student 4
             ↓
      Enrollment DB → [2,5]
             ↓
      Course Manager → Course 2
             ↓
      Course Manager → Course 5
             ↓
      List<CourseResponseDto> = [Course2, Course5]
             ↓
      StudentResponseDto
             ↓
      Final JSON